# twotex.part -- A block of three textures, for the marks of drawings
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A block 40 by 20 by 10 with three bosses 3 across on its top.  All of
# it is VDI 3400 Ref 30, which covers the most, but the top of the block
# and of the bosses, Ref 18, and its front, Ref 24.
materials materials
profile p along z 0 0 0 side front 40 0 0 40 20 0 0 20 0
extrude blk from 0 to 10 p
circle b 3 10 10 along z
extrude bosses from 10 to 12 b pattern +x 3 10
union twotex blk bosses
finish vdi30 any
finish vdi18 blk.end bosses.end
finish vdi24 blk.front
